      "correct": 1,
      "explanation": "The answer describes the person, so the question is ¿Cómo es…? (What is he like?)",
      "optionNotes": [
        "¿Qué es? asks for a definition.",
        null,
        "¿Quién es? would be answered with a name.",
        "¿Cuál es? asks for one item of information."
      ]
    },
